          "summary": "The owner or controller of account ACC-B1 remains unknown. The account-registry excerpt lists ACC-B1 as active but leaves the owner and controller fields blank and contains no identity-verification record, customer identifier, or provider signature connecting the account to Bob Niran or another individual.",
