          "summary": "Device inventory listed laptop B-17 as issued to Bob Niran, but no session record linked B-17 to ACC-B1 and the inventory did not establish who used the laptop during any relevant event. Device issuance is an association, not proof of account control.",
          "timestamp_text": null
